kicad-agent
===========

This directory contains a downstream KiCad integration that links against
KiCad's GPLv3-licensed protobuf API definitions and libraries.  The combined
binary (kicad-agent built with IPC support, and the kicad-cli "agent"
subcommand) is therefore distributed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or later.  See LICENSE.

Upstream components:

  * easyeda-agent (tools/ai/upstream/easyeda-agent), MIT License,
    https://github.com/zhoushoujianwork/easyeda-agent
  * NNG (statically linked when KICAD_BUILD_AI_AGENT_IPC=ON), MIT License,
    https://nng.nanomutt.org/
  * Go modules listed in kicad-agent/go.sum (MIT/BSD/Apache-2.0); their
    license texts are available from the respective module repositories.

The EasyEDA agent's MIT notice applies to its own source files.  KiCad's
LICENSE.README lists the remaining third-party components used by the
application.
